{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就這樣，在安潔的指示下，同學們開始幫忙製作蛋糕。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每個人做好自己負責的部分，分工合作得很順利。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔！今天要用的材料已經搬完了。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瞭解，那麼裝飾物製作小組的各位，可以開始動手囉！」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2643", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我這邊就繼續確認財務支出。」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 392, "voice": "ar4122", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「遵命，麻煩妳了！這個部份也很重要呢！」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2644", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼裝飾物製作小組的各位，請看～請把剛送達的可可亞撒在手上，然後做出形狀吧～這樣那樣這樣那樣！」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2645", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好快！而且好厲害！安潔那種技術模仿不來啊～」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ja0072", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，畢竟要當範本，必須拿出高水準的東西才行呢。」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2646", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好～如果有問題可以隨時問安潔喔～」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2647", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「塑形巧克力裡好像有塑膠。」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "sk1024", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有那個問題喔！？就像昨天給各位看的那樣，裡面只有麥芽糖跟蔗糖而已喔！」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2648", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看著裝飾物製作小組的模樣，我擦了擦汗喃喃自語。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔是個女僕，基本上不管是誰說的話她都會回「遵命」並且聽從……", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過像這樣照看旁人、指導旁人，似乎也非常適合她呢。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～感覺好像發現了喜歡的人新的一面……」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊，不好意思。安潔要暫時離開一會喔！」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2649", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主人。」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2650", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此時，安潔暫停了指導，朝我這邊跑過來。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「您的頭髮亂了喔。汗水要再擦乾一點才行。」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2651", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在百忙之中，安潔也沒有忘記她是我的女僕。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她取出手帕，一邊用手梳理我的頭髮，一邊擦拭我額頭上的汗水。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，欸嘿嘿，這樣又是平常那個優秀的主人了！」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2652", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈……謝謝妳。抱歉喔，占用了妳的時間。」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是安潔想為您做的……」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2653", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔希望主人一直都是這麼優秀。因為不管怎麼樣，您都是安潔最喜歡的主人！」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2654", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好親熱喔……唉唉～」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 406, "voice": "jc0063", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「暫時丟下我們去找主人啊……」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "sa0043", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是好好喔，好像新婚夫妻。安潔也很快樂的樣子。」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ja0073", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……抱歉，拖得太久了呢。真的很謝謝妳，安潔。」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到幸福洋溢的安潔，有的人忌妒，也有的人羨慕。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "總之我已經沒問題了，我示意安潔回去原本在做的事。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，安潔也謝謝您。」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2655", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔喔喔，失禮了！那麼就繼續工作吧～」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2656", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其他小組的各位如果有什麼問題，請立刻跟安潔說喔～」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2657", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼什麼，已經不用管主人了嗎？」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ja0074", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀啊，請不要調侃安潔啦～安潔好羞恥喔～」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2658", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「與其說調侃，是安潔自己破綻太多了沒辦法。」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "sk1025", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「的確沒辦法呢。快點繼續認真工作吧！」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2659", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，想一本正經地敷衍過去嗎？」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "sa0044", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要再爭論了，快點快點──」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2660", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結果大家嬉鬧了一陣子，又重新開始工作。", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然有很多值得吐槽的地方，不過「因為是安潔」所以大家也就接受了。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我要做什麼呢？」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 419, "voice": "ht0384", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「協助工作好像還要再一會才開始……」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛，到安潔下指示之前休息吧。我去準備飲料給大家。」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我也去～」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 419, "voice": "ht0385", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你很討厭閒著呢，隼太。」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像不是只有我喔。」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 419, "voice": "ht0386", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以這麼說。」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉喔，因為料理的時候小熊喵不能進去，所以我也沒辦法幫忙。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 412, "voice": "mu0435", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會不會，反而要謝謝妳陪我們來買東西。」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕……」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 400, "voice": "pn0123", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵也謝謝喔。蛋糕做好後妳也吃吧！」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕！！」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 400, "voice": "pn0124", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂混張傢伙，我也要幫忙。」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "sn0389", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，真的？」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 419, "voice": "ht0387", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要誤會了！我是要代替溫柔的美羽學姊幫忙！」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "sn0390", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊～我會連美羽學姊的份也一起幫忙混帳瓜生和安潔的～」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "sn0391", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇啊，謝謝妳小紗凪！」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 412, "voice": "mu0436", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小紗凪好溫柔喔，乖孩子乖孩子～」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 412, "voice": "mu0437", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊無上幸福的瞬間……就是想要這個～」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "sn0392", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對了，安潔被新吾摸頭的時候也是這種感覺呢。」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 419, "voice": "ht0388", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔也只對她暱稱『小紗同學』，這兩個人或許是很相像又要好的關係吧。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好！走吧混帳傢伙們！我來幫忙了，等著吧安潔～」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "sn0393", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，就麻煩妳照這樣子做喔。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2661", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這裡要像這樣做。戳一下戳一下……好了完成了！」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2662", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "sn0394", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我沒有幫忙的餘地吧？」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "sn0395", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，沒有那種事啦……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我明白乾同學會這麼說的心情。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "裙子和圍裙隨著她到處移動而翻飛，安潔手腳俐落地進行著工作。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隨著製作蛋糕的工作步上軌道，越是忙碌就越感覺到她的壓倒性的存在感──", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看得著迷了。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吶紗凪同學，仔細一看，感覺女僕裝好可愛喔……」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "jb0034", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯啊？怎麼突然說這個。」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "sn0396", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有啊，妳看，安潔轉身的時候裙襬搖搖的樣子好可愛……」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "jb0035", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像是這樣喔主人。」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 419, "voice": "ht0389", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我懂那感覺。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且因為穿的人是安潔，感覺又更可愛了。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為那麼可愛的女孩，做起事情來又能幹又俐落。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「眼睛的地方用白巧克力做吧。像這樣戳一下戳一下……」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2663", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇、哇、好厲害……雖然剛才也看到了，不過這也太漂亮了吧～」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ja0075", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀～安潔真的好厲害！為什麼妳會那麼多事情呢？」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ja0076", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，因為安潔是女僕喔！」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2664", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前就經常聽到她說這句話，不過現在聽起來卻有了不同的感受。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "製作蛋糕的計畫，成為了讓我重新認識「現在的安潔」的一個契機。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，各項準備工作都進行得比預想中還要順利呢……」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2665", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們一直工作到日落，巧克力裝飾這部分累積了相當多的進度。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「話雖如此，無論怎麼努力，前一天晚上還是得在學校過夜才行吧？」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，這也沒辦法。到時恐怕烤爐必須全日運轉，安潔也要專心一直擠生奶油呢。」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2666", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過多虧了裝飾物的準備很順利，負擔輕鬆了不少。」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2667", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且當天要使用的材料也訂購好了……」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2668", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "關上冰箱，安潔轉身面對大家。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，各位今天辛苦了！」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2669", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天一天請好好休息，星期日到休業式當天，終於要製作蛋糕本體囉♪」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2670", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "同學們喔喔喔地興奮了起來。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要工作進展得順利，就算疲憊也還是很開心呢。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還有明天可以休息這個意外驚喜，加深了喜悅的感覺。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼那麼，大家可以借給安潔一點時間嗎？」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ag2671", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，還有什麼事嗎？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 392, "voice": "ar4123", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「善後整理也已經結束了。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "sk1026", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
